<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-16610] Test IgniteClusterActivateDeactivateTestWithPersistence.testDeactivateMXBean() fails on master</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-16610</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;IgniteClusterActivateDeactivateTestWithPersistence.testDeactivateMXBean() fails on TC in master branch: &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/project.html?projectId=IgniteTests24Java8&amp;amp;buildTypeId=&amp;amp;tab=testDetails&amp;amp;testNameId=-3878708931279920024&amp;amp;order=TEST_STATUS_DESC&amp;amp;branch_IgniteTests24Java8=__all_branches__&amp;amp;itemsCount=50&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/project.html?projectId=IgniteTests24Java8&amp;amp;buildTypeId=&amp;amp;tab=testDetails&amp;amp;testNameId=-3878708931279920024&amp;amp;order=TEST_STATUS_DESC&amp;amp;branch_IgniteTests24Java8=__all_branches__&amp;amp;itemsCount=50&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It also fails locally.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It looks like the failures were introduced by &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/commit/45da1f56bb2d39e44bbd543882f9d1fe4397a439&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/commit/45da1f56bb2d39e44bbd543882f9d1fe4397a439&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;IgniteClusterActivateDeactivateTestWithPersistenceAndMemoryReuse.testDeactivateMXBean fails similarly.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
