&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=6429423&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_RunAll&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TeamCity &lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All&lt;/b&gt; Results&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17496124" author="slava.koptilin" created="Tue, 22 Feb 2022 14:17:29 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;The root cause is that a cache, without an explicitly defined data region, is erroneously considered as in-memory instead of using the default data region configuration/settings.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
